# Licensing

This repository is licensed in two parts, because it holds two different kinds
of thing.

## The design systems — MIT

The markdown files under `systems/<slug>/<slug>.md`, their generated
`preview.html`, and anything under a system's `assets/` directory.

Copy them into any project, commercial or otherwise, adapt them, ship them.
That is what they are for: every system file opens with instructions to install
it into another project.

