## The site — all rights reserved

Copyright (c) 2026 rorpheeyah. All rights reserved.

Covers the browse UI and everything that builds it: `scripts/`,
`site/assets/`, `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, the skills under `.claude/`, and the
written content of the site's own pages.

## Reference records — not mine to license

A system whose frontmatter says `origin: reference` is a reading of someone
else's published work.

The annotations, the approximated tokens and the criticism in such a file are
mine and fall under the MIT licence above. **The design being described does
not.** It belongs to its authors, who are credited in the file's `credit`
field and on its page. No assets from the original are reproduced here — the
token values are approximations made by eye from published screenshots, not
transcriptions of anyone's source.

At the time of writing that applies to:

- `systems/pharmly/` — *Pharmacy Management Admin Dashboard UI Design* by
  Opedia Studio, Samsun Nahar and M A Monim, published on Behance,
  13 December 2024.

If you are one of the credited authors and would like a record amended or
removed, open an issue and it will be.
